      en: ["Focuses on irrigation from the Hadejia-Jama'are river system", "Major producer of hibiscus for the global market", "Project started in the late 1990s", "Combines desertification control with commercial farming", "Promotes large-scale cultivation of date palms", "Provides training for over 1,000 young farmers annually"],
